  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Peanut butter lasagna is a rich, no-bake dessert made with layers of graham cracker crust, creamy peanut butter filling, whipped cream, and chocolate ganache. Topped with chopped peanuts and a sprinkle of sea salt, this easy recipe delivers the perfect balance of sweet, salty, and crunchy in every bite. Peanut butter lasagna is simple to prepare, requires no oven time, and is an ideal make-ahead treat for parties, potlucks, or family gatherings.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-peanut-butter-lasagna\">Why You’ll Love This Peanut Butter Lasagna</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-peanut-butter-lasagna\">How to Make Peanut Butter Lasagna</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-peanut-butter-lasagna\">Pro Tips for Making Peanut Butter Lasagna</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-peanut-butter-lasagna\">How to Serve this Peanut Butter Lasagna</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-peanut-butter-lasagna\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Peanut Butter Lasagna</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Decadent layers of creamy peanut butter and rich chocolate.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make, perfect for any occasion or gathering.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Delightfully satisfying without being overly sweet.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>A crowd-pleaser that will have everyone asking for seconds!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3674\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3674\" data-servings=\"12\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Irresistible-Layers-of-Peanut-Butter-Lasagna.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"Irresistible Peanut Butter Lasagna dessert with a chocolate cookie base and toppings on a white plate against a turquoise backdrop.\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Irresistible-Layers-of-Peanut-Butter-Lasagna.webp 500w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Irresistible-Layers-of-Peanut-Butter-Lasagna-300x300.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Irresistible-Layers-of-Peanut-Butter-Lasagna-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">Peanut Butter Lasagna</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal\">Indulge in the creamy layers of Peanut Butter Lasagna! This ultimate dessert delight combines rich flavors for a sweet treat you can&#8217;t resist! 🍰🥜</div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 20px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wprm_pr